s, voiceovers and interviews — available with Source Connect and broadcast-quality mics.\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Yorkshire Podcast Studio "}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Yorkshire Podcast Studio – a professional recording space for podcasts, voiceovers, interviews and content creators. Fully treated, broadcast-quality sound with Neumann microphones and a relaxed, private environment.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Professional Podcast Studio in West Yorkshire</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you're looking for a high-quality podcast studio in Yorkshire, this space is built for creators who need crystal-clear audio without the hassle of setting up their own kit. It’s hosted TV presenter <strong>Chris Kamara</strong> (who also recorded with me for Santa Radio using my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Santa Voice</a>), Emmerdale actors, game developers, agency producers, and medical voiceover clients.</p>\r\n<p>Located in a quiet, discreet neighbourhood with off-street parking, this studio is ideal for recording podcasts, interviews, narration, or video content voiceovers in a comfortable, professional environment.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9bs4CJ4RixI","title":"Yorkshire Podcast Studio ","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/west-yorkshire-studio-march25.jpg","alt":"yorkshire-podcast-studio","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Yorkshire Podcast Studio "}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>What’s Inside the Studio?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The studio is fitted with <strong>Neumann U87 microphones</strong>, professional preamps, acoustic treatment, and broadcast-quality monitoring. Whether you’re recording a podcast, a commercial, interviews or long-form content, you’ll get clean, consistent, professional sound.</p>\r\n<p>If you want to see more of the technical setup or room layout, take a look at the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Voiceover Studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">main Voiceover Studio page</a>.</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section ","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Used by Professionals</strong></h2>\r\n<p>This West Yorkshire studio has been trusted by producers from TV, radio and gaming, including <strong>Chris Kamara</strong>, agency teams working on national brands, Emmerdale actors, medical organisations, and content creators who need reliable, polished audio. Whether you’re a <strong>podcaster</strong>, <strong>broadcaster</strong>, <strong>voice artist</strong>, or <strong>business owner</strong>, this space is perfect for achieving premium sound.</p>"}}],null]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Book Your Podcast Studio Today</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you need a podcast studio in Yorkshire that delivers clean, broadcast-quality audio, this space is available to hire by the hour or the day. Ideal for creators, businesses and broadcasters.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Podcast Studio Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy about podcast studio hire\">Email Guy</a> or <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy about studio hire\">get in touch</a> to check availability and book your session.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Yorkshire Podcast Studio ","pageUrl":"yorkshire-podcast-studio"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","589",{"href":"/cities-talking-explainer-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/cities-talking-explainer-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","808",{"href":"/the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up.jpg","alt":"The perfect recording studio set up","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Setting up your Recording studio"}]]}],["$","$L3","959",{"href":"/arabella-harris-girl-child-voiceover-kid","className":"blog-related-card","childre